# --- resourcestrings (upagesample) ---

#: upagesample.rspgtitle
msgid "A page built from code"
msgstr "用代码搭的页面"

#: upagesample.rspgintro
msgid "This page is not a file. It is made in `upagesample.pas` with **TTyRichBuilder**, in calls that read the way the page does: **bold words**, a word in !!red!!, links, lists, tab stops, a table and a picture."
msgstr "这个页面不是文件，它是在 `upagesample.pas` 里用 **TTyRichBuilder** 搭出来的，调用的顺序就是页面的顺序：**加粗的词**、!!红色的字!!，还有链接、列表、制表位、表格和一张图片。"

#: upagesample.rspgcontents
msgid "Contents"
msgstr "目录"

#: upagesample.rspgweb
msgid "The Lazarus home page"
msgstr "Lazarus 主页"

#: upagesample.rspgs1
msgid "1. Showing a page"
msgstr "1. 展示一个页面"

#: upagesample.rspgs1a
msgid "A rich edit can show a page instead of editing one: an application's home page, a page that leads to its parts, its help. It is read only, has no caret, and a plain click on a link follows it."
msgstr "富文本控件可以用来展示页面，而不是编辑：应用的首页、导航页、帮助页。它只读、没有光标，单击链接就跳转。"

#: upagesample.rspgs1b
msgid "The same content is shown on two tabs of this window. The help page can be selected and copied and scrolls by itself. The home page cannot be selected, never takes the focus, has no scroll bars of its own and is as tall as its content: the scroll box around it scrolls the whole page."
msgstr "同样的内容在这个窗口的两个页签里各显示一次。帮助页可以选中、复制，自己滚动。首页不能选中，从不拿焦点，没有自己的滚动条，高度就是内容的高度：外面的滚动框滚动整个页面。"

#: upagesample.rspgnote
msgid "Note: switch the skin or the dark mode with this window open. The text and the links take the new theme's colours; only the colours the page chose itself stay."
msgstr "提示：开着这个窗口换皮肤或切换深色模式试试。文字和链接会换成新主题的颜色，只有页面自己指定的颜色不变。"

#: upagesample.rspgs1c
msgid "A click on an entry of the contents jumps to its section: the section's heading comes to the top of the view."
msgstr "点目录里的一项就跳到那一节：那一节的标题来到视图顶部。"

#: upagesample.rspgs2
msgid "2. Lists and tab stops"
msgstr "2. 列表和制表位"

#: upagesample.rspgs2a
msgid "A bulleted list with a second level:"
msgstr "带第二级的项目符号列表："

#: upagesample.rspgbullet1
msgid "Links to the sections of the page"
msgstr "指向页面各节的链接"

#: upagesample.rspgbullet1a
msgid "each one jumps to a bookmark"
msgstr "每个都跳到一个书签"

#: upagesample.rspgbullet1b
msgid "and \"Back to the top\" jumps back"
msgstr "\"回到顶部\"跳回来"

#: upagesample.rspgbullet2
msgid "Pictures from an image list, an icon font, a file or a resource"
msgstr "图片可以来自图像列表、图标字体、文件或资源"

#: upagesample.rspgbullet3
msgid "Tables with the widths you give their columns"
msgstr "表格的列宽由你指定"

#: upagesample.rspgs2b
msgid "A numbered list:"
msgstr "编号列表："

#: upagesample.rspgstep1
msgid "Make a builder: B := Rich.NewBuilder"
msgstr "建一个构建器：B := Rich.NewBuilder"

#: upagesample.rspgstep1a
msgid "add the text, the formats and the links to it"
msgstr "往里加文字、格式和链接"

#: upagesample.rspgstep2
msgid "Put it in: Rich.SetContent(B)"
msgstr "放进控件：Rich.SetContent(B)"

#: upagesample.rspgstep3
msgid "Free the builder, or keep it and put it in again"
msgstr "释放构建器，或者留着再放一次"

#: upagesample.rspgs2c
msgid "Tab stops with a dot leader, as in a table of contents:"
msgstr "带点状前导符的制表位，像目录一样："

#: upagesample.rspgtab1
msgid "Showing a page"
msgstr "展示一个页面"

#: upagesample.rspgtab2
msgid "Lists and tab stops"
msgstr "列表和制表位"

#: upagesample.rspgtab3
msgid "A table"
msgstr "表格"

#: upagesample.rspgs3
msgid "3. A table"
msgstr "3. 表格"

#: upagesample.rspgs3a
msgid "Two columns, 1.5 and 3.5 inches wide:"
msgstr "两列，宽 1.5 英寸和 3.5 英寸："

#: upagesample.rspgcolprop
msgid "Property"
msgstr "属性"

#: upagesample.rspgcolwhat
msgid "On the home page"
msgstr "首页上的值"

#: upagesample.rspgreadonly
msgid "True: nothing can be typed"
msgstr "True：不能输入"

#: upagesample.rspgallowsel
msgid "False: nothing can be selected"
msgstr "False：不能选中"

#: upagesample.rspgfocus
msgid "False: a click never takes the focus"
msgstr "False：点击不拿焦点"

#: upagesample.rspgbars
msgid "ssNone: no scroll bars of its own"
msgstr "ssNone：没有自己的滚动条"

#: upagesample.rspgautoh
msgid "True: as tall as its content"
msgstr "True：高度跟着内容"

#: upagesample.rspgs3b
msgid "The table's cells hold text, links and pictures like any paragraph. The columns keep the widths given here whatever the window's width."
msgstr "表格的单元格和普通段落一样可以放文字、链接和图片。不管窗口多宽，各列都保持这里给的宽度。"

#: upagesample.rspgtop
msgid "Back to the top"
msgstr "回到顶部"

#: upagesample.rspgstamp
#, object-pascal-format
msgid "Appended at %s."
msgstr "追加于 %s。"
